1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
PersenseAI begins with video, images, text,
audio, and sensor signals.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
They become structured observations
with time, confidence, and provenance.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Visual Reward tracks
what changed over time.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
An evidence graph connects support, contradiction,
and unresolved uncertainty to their sources.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Evidence Utility estimates which observation mattered,
while redundancy and cost remain visible.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
A bounded orchestration agent ranks registered tools,
updates structured state, and tracks budget.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Agent Progress Reward explains whether each action
improved grounded resolution.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
When contradiction remains, it can replan—then return
a cited answer or stop inconclusive.
